WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.208
 You want me to talk about
when I come home at night

00:00:02.208 --> 00:00:03.780
and my sons ask me
what I did today?

00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:06.060
I actually say, well, I had
a meeting to talk about,

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:08.185
what are the core attributes
of a Disney princess?

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:13.120
One of the most
important things for us,

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:17.920
is show young women who are
empowered, is vital for us

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:20.560
to tell stories that
better reflect the world

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:22.440
that we're doing business in.

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:30.280
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:33.100
There's no way that you
can achieve great gains

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:36.850
without taking great chances.

00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:39.400
I'm going to cover a number
of subjects-- leadership

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:41.840
attributes, how to
manage creativity,

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:43.563
how to develop a strategy.

00:00:43.563 --> 00:00:44.980
The role of humor
in the workplace

00:00:44.980 --> 00:00:46.750
is just an extraordinary
distraction.

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:49.970
And there really is no place
for humor at the Walt Disney

00:00:49.970 --> 00:00:50.470
Company.

00:00:54.270 --> 00:00:56.580
I'm going to tell some
interesting stories about some

00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:59.160
of the biggest acquisitions the
Walt Disney Company has made.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.890
There's a picture on
my desk of my shaking

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:03.180
hands with Steve Jobs.

00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:08.850
That moment enabled me to say to
Steve, I got this crazy idea--

00:01:08.850 --> 00:01:11.490
we want to buy Pixar.

00:01:11.490 --> 00:01:14.550
When you create a brand,
ask yourself the question.

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:17.770
When I put that brand
name on the product,

00:01:17.770 --> 00:01:19.560
what does it convey?

00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:22.640
If I say to you, Disney,
you know exactly what it is.

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:24.000
It is a feeling inside you.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:27.570
You immediately have a
visceral feeling about it.

00:01:27.570 --> 00:01:31.230
My greatest hope for the next
generation of business leaders

00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:35.040
is that they bring to
the job great integrity.

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:38.400
And they achieve things that
ultimately create a better

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:43.062
world and a future that looks
brighter than the present.

00:01:43.062 --> 00:01:46.040
I'm Bob Iger, and this
is my MasterClass.

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:50.590
[MUSIC PLAYING]

